    "process_summary": "The car insurance claim process begins with the customer submitting claim. The Notification Department checks the documents and registers the claim. The Handling Department then check the insurance and assesses the claim. The Handling Department can reject the claim. If the claim is rejected, the customer is notified. If the claim is approved, the Handling Department arranges repair with a garage. The garage repairs the vehicle; the Handling Department arranges the payment. Finally, the customer is informed of the claim resolution.",
